A-Traductor does not collect any data.
The only communication is with Google (translate.google.com and translate.googleapis.com), Yandex (translate.yandex.net), Bing (bing.com), DeepL (deepl.com), and the AI translation providers you enable in settings.
These translation services (Google, Yandex, Bing, DeepL, OpenRouter, AiHubMix, or a custom OpenAI-compatible endpoint) can collect data to improve their services.
To translate, page or selected text content is sent to the translation service you selected.
For text to speech (tts) the text will be sent to Google.
The source code is available on <a href="https://github.com/itworksig/A-Traductor">Github</a>.
